    <briefdescription>
<para>Operator struct to check if an expression throws any exception. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This explicit specialisation checks whether invoking the given callable throws any exception, regardless of type. The check is performed at construction time, with the result cached for reporting and composition. Use this when a test must verify that an operation raises an exception without caring about the specific exception type. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
